WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.035 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:04.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, everybody, welcome
to this week's "Corrections,

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
where we're going to try
to address some

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:08.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the mistakes we made
because our efforts

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
are always
to get things exactly righ

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:14.347
and, when we don't, we're very
happy to admit we got it wrong

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
Screwed something up
top of the show.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:17.584 line:92%
In "A Closer Look," I referred

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:21.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the Afghani city of Kabul
as "Kabool."

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was told
right before I came out,

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:26.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Remember it's 'Kobble,'
not 'Kabool.'"

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.595 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Still said "Kabool."

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That one's on me.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:34.367
"Criminy" was in a sketch
this week, "Closer Look."

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.735 line:92%
I knew it was "crihmihnee.

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Shoemaker, over there,

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:38.505 line:92%
tells me it's "crime-ihnee."

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:40.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Will you cop to that?

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.441 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, 100%.

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I still think it is.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:45.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
Well, this isn't about that.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.312 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.381 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you can see how you get
bullied into something.

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, again,
I had eaten it pretty hard

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:55.622
on "surreptitiously" last week
and Shoemaker had corrected me

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:58.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I take his word for it
on criminy.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:01.094
By the way, I don't know
why I'm listening to him.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
Joe Manchin,
who's from West Virginia,

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.130 size:84% position:42% line:92%
is the guy who said it.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.632 size:88% position:44%
Shoemaker, over there,
is from the South Bronx.

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:09.636
It's not like he's using the
same jargon as West Virginians

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:12.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Just smoking weed in the '70s,

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
putting on James Taylor.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Shoemaker ]
Crime-ihnee, man.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:17.177 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:19.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
Couldn't be farther away
from West Virginia.

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:22.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only coal you ever dug
was John Coltrane.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:23.850 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Baze wrote that joke.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.821 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:31.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been told a bunch
that I say "pundit" wrong,

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:34.527 size:81% position:41% line:92%
that I say, "pundent."

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:35.562 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What else?

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.664 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:41.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, we had a joke
about Lindsey Graham directing

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:44.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
a musical version of "Our Town
in regional theater

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.874
and a bunch of people told m
that "Our Town" isn't a musical.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.275 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I know that.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.610 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I mean, it was a joke.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.378 line:92%
It's not, obviously, a good one.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:53.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
But...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
would "Our Town" be worse,
if it had a song?

00:01:56.349 --> 00:01:58.918 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
Bill Gates was on the show
and I guess, five or six times

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:03.990 line:92%
I called him "Phil" Gates.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:09.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:10.997 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What else?

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:11.698 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.698 --> 00:02:13.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I'm also going
to stop anybody

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
who's watching this
right now online

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:16.870 line:92%
and they're going to write

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:17.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
their comment's going
to be like,

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.806 size:75% position:38%
"Uh, I can't believe
this wasn't on TV."

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.808 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's, uh, [bleep] not.

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.009 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.044 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's only for YouTube.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.379 line:92%
Just looks like it's on TV

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:29.516 size:75% position:38%
Because we're paying
TV money to make it.

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:30.450 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.853
But, all in all, I think,
a pretty good week, right?

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:34.921 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:41.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we got criminy, Kabul,
pundit, Bill Gates.

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.428 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:44.564 size:78% position:39%
Alright, there we go.
Thank you, everybody.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:47.367 line:92%
Thank you for your feedback.

